   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "室内设计师Anna Cardell的肖像照。",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<h2>狭小不堪的空间</h2>\n<p>参与集装箱房屋设计的设计师Anna Cardell说：&ldquo;以这种方式生活在城市里很酷，无论你的空间有多小、住几天，彰显自我和满足自身需求依然很重要。&rdquo;该团队着手在大小相同的两个小集装箱内设计两个不同的家。&ldquo;难就难在要打造出既实用，又充满特色的小型家居空间。&rdquo;</p>"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/a7/a0/a7a070d57e1b33912d7080aeb4f3a024.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/a7/a0/a7a070d57e1b33912d7080aeb4f3a024.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-quote",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "Anna Cardell，室内设计师",
    "我觉得这恰恰就是人们的居住方式趋势。小型空间、临时住宅、经常搬家以及社区生活，日益频繁地成为我们谈论的对象。"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "两个人坐在一间房内的坐卧两用床上，房间内配备一个开放式挂衣杆和带脚轮手推车，椅子存放在墙壁上。",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "50231630"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/cc/7e/cc7e169a6c2543be75cf2268934d4486.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/cc/7e/cc7e169a6c2543be75cf2268934d4486.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "一张带轮子的桌子，下面有储物篮；两个小凳子和一张坐卧两用床。",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "s89130041"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/70/06/7006d84c37420077c000874a4db21a73.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/92/98/9298e0427f98dc56820f349543190f8e.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/70/06/7006d84c37420077c000874a4db21a73.jpg",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/92/98/9298e0427f98dc56820f349543190f8e.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-quote",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "Anna Cardell，室内设计师",
    "如果你只有一个房间，共享同一个空间，或经常搬家，那么便利性就至关重要。不妨考虑购置有把手、脚轮的轻便产品，去哪儿都方便携带。"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "一个白色低矮储物单元，上面放着图片、灯具和镜子；白色的波纹墙壁上挂着衣服。",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "s29239497"
   ],
