   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "白色的卧室里配备素色纺织品，沙发床和盆栽植物周围垂下层层透明的窗帘。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "s89149597",
    "80374608",
    "30398452"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/8c/53/8c539b604deba5e92fe497bf8bff0a5f.jpg"
